<title>JAPAN: Japan to offer 10-yr, 2-yr JGBs next week--sources.</title>
<headline>Japan to offer 10-yr, 2-yr JGBs next week--sources.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance is likely to offer 10-year Japanese government bonds (JGBs) on November 26 and two-year JGBs on November 28 through price-competitive auctions, market sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>---Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8676</p>
